{
  "_comment": "Prompt 10b (2026-09-26) adds `lists[]`: list-valued control keys (today only `sectors` -> `active_sectors`), whose `sectors`/`aliases` vocabulary is config/etfs.json's sleeve verbatim (asserted by test). Prompt 3.2. Single source ops/control.py (json.load) reads to build its known-verb set, its HELP_TEXT and its per-table key whitelist. A plain on/off toggle (master, core, dip, surge) is added here alone — its apply logic is a one-line dispatch keyed by 'key'/'table'. Verbs whose logic is genuinely bespoke (block's reason arg, clear's multi-key reset, last/holds' reads, status's summary) still have hand-written apply code, but their name/help/whitelist membership still comes from here so nothing can drift.",
