      "name": "clear",
      "table": "control",
      "help": "clear                clears entries_blocked (+ reason, + until_cleared) AND resets divergence_streak to 0 — use this instead of 'block off' when a persistent-divergence block just fired, or it re-blocks on the next cycle"
    },
